<title>UK: BOE allots 2.0 bln stg on UK money market repos.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 2.0 bln stg on UK money market repos.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted a total 2.0 billion stg in repurchase and secured loan facilities at 5-31/32 percent for the UK money market.</p>
<p>It is offering 159 million stg on the repo due on February 6, 7 &amp; 10 and 1.841 billion stg in the repo due on February 20, 21 &amp; 24.</p>
<p>Both facilities open tomorrow, Thursday Jan 23. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
